ction class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group margin-top margin-xxhuge"><img src="/assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora 2000.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 41vw" width="753" alt="image background" srcset="/assets/images/final/64ff16f82f581d333f7617eb_Pitagora 2000.png 700w" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"><img src="/assets/images/final/65005a2868ffd386eb7d1dd0_istok vs zapad -zemlje.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/65005a2868ffd386eb7d1dd0_istok vs zapad -zemlje.png 700w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 94vw, 41vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"></div></div><div id="w-node-_4f789385-f466-7ec5-a89c-ebb871901eee-418f856d" class="layout58_content" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="text-size-large-2">Na zapadu su u proizvodnji digitalnih džepnih kalkulatora prednjačili SAD, Japan, Zapadna Njemačka i UK, dok su istočne perjanice bile SSSR, Istočna Njemačka i Bugarska. <br><br>Dok su na zapadu cijene kalkulatora drastično spuštane ne bi li se ovladalo tržištem, Sovjeti su svoje cijene gravirali u kućišta.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_7f61f6d4-ce73-ee7f-9842-ff3d56295a91-418f856d" class="layout58_content" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Kalkulatori u svemiru<br></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"><img src="/assets/images/final/64de5bee3c9344858be51109_Digtroni u svemiru-s.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de5bee3c9344858be51109_Digtroni u svemiru-s.jpg 550w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Hladni rat između zapada i istoka odvijao se i u svemiru, a kalkulatori u svemirskim misijama služe kao rezervno rješenje prilikom izračunavanja putanje, kuta ulaska u atmosferu te potrošnje goriva.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"><img src="/assets/images/final/64de5bee3c9344858be51109_Digtroni u svemiru-s.jpg" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de5bee3c9344858be51109_Digtroni u svemiru-s.jpg 550w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"><img src="/assets/images/final/65005f9f68ffd386eb840a60_Kalkulatori u svemiru 2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/65005f9f68ffd386eb840a60_Kalkulatori u svemiru 2.png 700w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 41vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"></div></div><div id="w-node-_9bc4024d-0c0b-f018-0009-19f00ae0bf28-418f856d" class="layout58_content" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"><img src="/assets/images/final/65005f9f68ffd386eb840a60_Kalkulatori u svemiru 2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/65005f9f68ffd386eb840a60_Kalkulatori u svemiru 2.png 700w" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, (max-width: 736px) 95vw, (max-width: 991px) 700px, 100vw" class="featured-image image-size-no-background"></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Amerikanci su 1969. za slijetanje na Mjesec koristili talijanski programabilni stolni kalkulator Olivetti Programma 101 popularno zvan Perottina. <br><br>Prvi džepni digitalni kalkulator u svemiru bio HP-35 korišten u američkoj misiji Skylab 3 1973. godine, a prvi digitalni kalkulator koji je proveo više od godine u svemiru bio je sovjetska Elektronika MK36 kojeg je 1986. na svemirsku stanicu Mir donio kozmonaut Juri Romanenko.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div 